spice
* NMOS Amplifier Circuit
V1 1 0 DC 0        ; Input voltage source (V_in)
? Missing component
M1 3 1 5 5 NMOS    ; NMOS transistor: Drain=3, Gate=1, Source=5, Body=5
RL 2 3 RL          ; Load resistor: connected between V_DD (2) and node 3
